      <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/flickbar/flickbar/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Added

- **Full Screen from the Dock.** Assign Full Screen to Pinch Out or another gesture on an app's Dock icon to toggle its focused window into or out of full screen; Pinch Out still does nothing by default.

### Fixed

- Gestures on a Safari web app's Dock icon work again after the web app is re-created; before, they did nothing until Flickbar was restarted.]]></description>
